          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Contact {{BUSINESS_NAME}} to discuss structured wellness habits, coaching memberships, and outcomes-focused plans.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg:#ffffff;--text:#0b1720;--muted:#6b7780;--accent:#0a84ff;--card:#f7f9fb;--radius:12px;--max:980px;--gap:28px;\\n      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:48px auto;padding:36px}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:28px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}\\n    .brand h1{font-size:18px;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.2px}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin:0 10px;font-size:14px}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:var(--gap);align-items:start}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);padding:22px;border-radius:var(--radius)}\\n    h2{margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:20px}\\n    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px 0}\\n    form label{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--text)}\\n    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #e4e9ee;border-radius:8px;background:white}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    button.primary{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:none;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}\\n    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}\\n    .pillars{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .pillar{background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;flex:1;border:1px solid #eef3f7}\\n    .case{margin-top:18px}\\n    .faq{margin-top:18px}\\n    details{background:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;border:1px solid #eef3f7;margin-bottom:10px}\\n    footer{margin-top:28px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    /* Responsive */\\n    @media (max-width:900px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.wrap{padding:20px;margin:20px auto}}\\n    /* Minimal SVG sizing */\\n    .avatar{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden}\\n    .small-hero{width:100%;height:120px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}\\n    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:14px}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\" role=\\\"main\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"avatar\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n          <!-- Inline avatar SVG unique to this template -->\\n          <svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 64 64\\\" width=\\\"64\\\" height=\\\"64\\\">\\n            <rect width=\\\"64\\\" height=\\\"64\\\" rx=\\\"12\\\" fill=\\\"#eef7ff\\\" />\\n            <g transform=\\\"translate(8 8)\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#0a84ff\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\">\\n              <circle cx=\\\"24\\\" cy=\\\"14\\\" r=\\\"10\\\" fill=\\\"#dff1ff\\\" stroke=\\\"none\\\" />\\n              <path d=\\\"M4 42c4-8 24-8 28 0\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" />\\n            </g>\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav aria-label=\\\"Primary\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Plans</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"testimonials.html\\\">Stories</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <!-- Hero / Contact focus -->\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:260px\\\">\\n          <h2>Reach out — pragmatic support for lasting habits</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Start a short diagnostic, request a membership overview, or schedule a discovery call with {{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}. We focus on replicable routines and measurable outcomes in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} and remote.</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"cta-row\\\">\\n            <a class=\\\"primary\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n            <a class=\\\"muted\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Schedule a discovery</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"width:220px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"small-hero\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n            <!-- Inline pattern SVG unique to this template -->\\n            <svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 200 120\\\">\\n              <defs>\\n                <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n                  <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#f0fbff\\\" />\\n                  <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#eef7ff\\\" />\\n                </linearGradient>\\n              </defs>\\n              <rect width=\\\"200\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" rx=\\\"12\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\" />\\n              <g fill=\\\"#d6eefc\\\" transform=\\\"translate(20 20)\\\">\\n                <rect x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"8\\\" rx=\\\"4\\\"/>\\n                <rect x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"18\\\" width=\\\"58\\\" height=\\\"8\\\" rx=\\\"4\\\"/>\\n                <rect x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"36\\\" width=\\\"30\\\" height=\\\"8\\\" rx=\\\"4\\\"/>\\n              </g>\\n            </svg>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"grid\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\">\\n      <main>\\n        <!-- Contact form card -->\\n        <section class=\\\"card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"contact-heading\\\">\\n          <h2 id=\\\"contact-heading\\\">Contact form — concise intake</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Tell us briefly what you'd like to change. We prioritize habit-based plans, 8- to 12-week transformations, and ongoing memberships.</p>\\n          <form action=\\\"#\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" onsubmit=\\\"return handleSubmit(event)\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px;\\\">\\n            <label for=\\\"name\\\">Full name</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required>\\n            <label for=\\\"email\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">Email</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\" required>\\n            <label for=\\\"phone\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">Phone (optional)</label>\\n            <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\">\\n            <label for=\\\"message\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">What outcome are you aiming for?</label>\\n            <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" rows=\\\"4\\\" placeholder=\\\"A short description of your goals\\\" required></textarea>\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n              <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"primary\\\">Send inquiry</button>\\n              <a class=\\\"muted\\\" href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">Or email: {{EMAIL}}</a>\\n            </div>\\n          </form>\\n          <div class=\\\"case\\\">\\n            <h3 style=\\\"font-size:15px;margin:14px 0 8px 0\\\">Quick case notes</h3>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Recent outcomes: improved sleep routines, daily movement habit formation, and better energy distribution across the workday. We document changes weekly and adjust small experiments.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <!-- Myth vs Truth ripple (compact) -->\\n        <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n          <h2>Common assumptions — a scientist's take</h2>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:grid;gap:10px;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start\\\">\\n              <strong style=\\\"width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#0a84ff;margin-top:6px;display:inline-block\\\"></strong>\\n              <div>\\n                <div style=\\\"font-weight:600\\\">Myth</div>\\n                <div class=\\\"muted\\\">I need a full life overhaul for change to stick.</div>\\n                <div style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">Truth: Small, repeated experiments reduce friction and create durable habit pathways. We design minimal viable habits first.</div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start\\\">\\n              <strong style=\\\"width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#0a84ff;margin-top:6px;display:inline-block\\\"></strong>\\n              <div>\\n                <div style=\\\"font-weight:600\\\">Myth</div>\\n                <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Accountability means constant check-ins.</div>\\n                <div style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">Truth: Structured accountability with clear metrics and weekly learning keeps momentum while preserving autonomy.</div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <!-- FAQ compact -->\\n        <section class=\\\"card faq\\\" aria-label=\\\"FAQ\\\">\\n          <h2>Practical questions</h2>\\n          <details>\\n            <summary style=\\\"cursor:pointer\\\">How do you structure a membership?</summary>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Members receive a diagnostic, a 12-week action plan, weekly check-ins, and monthly reviews. Plans are adapted to measurable behaviors, not prescriptions.</div>\\n          </details>\\n          <details>\\n            <summary style=\\\"cursor:pointer\\\">Is this appropriate for beginners?</summary>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Yes. The first stage is habit scaffolding — small experiments, clear metrics, and low friction tasks to build confidence.</div>\\n          </details>\\n          <details>\\n            <summary style=\\\"cursor:pointer\\\">Can I book a one-off consultation?</summary>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Yes — use the booking page to request a single diagnostic consult or a series. Memberships are for ongoing momentum.</div>\\n          </details>\\n        </section>\\n      </main>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <section class=\\\"card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"contact-side\\\">\\n          <h3 id=\\\"contact-side\\\">Direct contact & booking</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"meta\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n            <div><strong>Phone</strong>: <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n            <div><strong>Email</strong>: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n            <div><strong>Location</strong>: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n            <a class=\\\"primary\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book a discovery</a>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n            <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">Pillars I use</h4>\\n            <div class=\\\"pillars\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n                <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Measure</div>\\n                <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">Simple metrics that track behavior, not feelings.</div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n                <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Iterate</div>\\n                <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">Small experiments, weekly adjustments.</div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"pillar\\\">\\n                <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Sustain</div>\\n                <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">Structure for repetition and context cues.</div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">Short case snapshot</h4>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:600\\\">Three-month membership: shifted irregular sleepers to consistent 7-hour windows; energy scores improved via micro-routines.</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">We document baseline, interventions, and signal changes to know what worked and why.</div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">Policies & privacy</h4>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Conversations are confidential. We collect minimal personal data for scheduling and care coordination.</div>\\n        </section>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <h2>Ready to begin?</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\">If you prefer phone or email, use the contacts above. Otherwise start with the short intake form — it takes under five minutes and guides our first session.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <a class=\\\"primary\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"muted\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\" style=\\\"margin-left:12px\\\">See membership options</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div class=\\\"muted\\\">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} • <a href=\\\"privacy.html\\\" style=\\\"color:inherit;text-decoration:underline\\\">Privacy</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    function handleSubmit(e){\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      const form = e.target;\\n      const name = form.name.value.trim();\\n      const email = form.email.value.trim();\\n      if(!name || !email){\\n        alert('Please provide name and email.');\\n        return false;\\n      }\\n      // Simulate submission flow for this static prototype\\n      alert('Thanks, ' + name + '. Your request has been noted. We will reply to ' + email + '.');\\n      form.reset();\\n      return false;\\n    }\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# Contact Page — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n\\nThis bundle contains the contact page (contact.html) for the zen_minimal wellness coach site and a README describing usage.\\n\\nFiles in this chunk:\\n- contact.html — standalone, minimal-contact experience optimized for clarity and conversion.\\n\\nDesign notes:\\n- Layout family: zen_minimal — lots of white space, restrained type scale, and an ultra-clean grid.\\n- Voice: scientist_guide — measured, evidence-oriented, practical language to set expectations.\\n- Required sections ripple: hero (top explanatory panel), myth_vs_truth (compact), pillars, case snapshot, faq, and a clear CTA.\\n- The page includes inline SVG artwork so no external assets are required in this chunk. In the final project, you can extract these to assets/img/*.svg as desired.\\n\\nPlaceholders used (replace values during templating or deploy-time):\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\n- {{PHONE}}\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n- {{COACH_NAME}}\\n- {{CREDENTIALS}}\\n- {{CITY}}\\n- {{STATE}}\\n\\nHow to integrate:\\n- Drop contact.html into your static site root or template renderer.\\n- Replace placeholders with environment variables or templating engine values.\\n- The page links to other pages in the site (index.html, about.html, programs.html, pricing.html, testimonials.html, book.html). Keep those files in the same directory for correct navigation.\\n\\nAccessibility & privacy:\\n- Form uses standard labels and sensible required fields.\\n- No tracking or external resources are included in this prototype.\\n\\nNotes for developers:\\n- The form handler is a simple JS stub (handleSubmit). Replace with your backend or a third-party form endpoint.\\n- If you extract inline SVGs to files, update src references accordingly and keep unique file names to avoid collisions across templates.\\n\\nLicense: this file is part of the {{BUSINESS_NAME}} design system. Replace all placeholder tokens with your project's real values prior to publishing.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
